# anthropic_memory_stores (Data Source)

Lists memory stores (beta). All pages are fetched automatically. Archived stores are excluded by default, mirroring the API's default behavior; set `include_archived = true` to include them.

> **API**: `GET /v1/memory_stores` (Managed Agents API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: `agent-memory-2026-07-22`.

